  message: "Fixed in PR #2093. containment.py: constructor added to CONTAINABLE_KINDS, so a constructor is contained by its class. Live repro: survey of a Java Main that runs new Runner(...) -> containment hop Runner -> Runner.Runner, and calls Main.go -> Runner.Runner at line 5. Test: TestConstructorsAreContained (Java, and Dart with new). Dart construction without new emits no edge at all; that is WI-sujon, still open."  # 3d22
